// Five invariants:
// (1) chi = V - E + F; sphere: (V,E,F)=(4,6,4) or (8,12,6) or... -> chi=2; torus: (7,21,14) -> chi=0
// (2) winding number = (total angle change) / (2π); e^(it) -> 1; e^(3it) -> 3; misses -> 0
// (3) knot coloring: unknot 3 valid colorings, trefoil 9
// (4) vector-field index: source +1, saddle -1; sphere: +1 + 1 = 2 (sum = chi)
// (5) curvature integral: sphere (round or stretched) -> 4π
